                    \\,.
            %p
              Since the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fat+simplex"} fat simplex
              is cofibrant in
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
